      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Human in the loop: the evaluator and the reviewer only advise. The recruiter approves or rejects each candidate and the decision is stored with the AI rating.\nResumes pass a prompt shield before scoring. Cosmos DB and Storage accept private-endpoint traffic only, and the data and AI services use Microsoft Entra ID (keys disabled).",
      "originalText": "Human in the loop: the evaluator and the reviewer only advise. The recruiter approves or rejects each candidate and the decision is stored with the AI rating.\nResumes pass a prompt shield before scoring. Cosmos DB and Storage accept private-endpoint traffic only, and the data and AI services use Microsoft Entra ID (keys disabled).",
